  _kind: 0
  _pose: 0
  _dialogText: Borrowing helps you grow faster. You don't have to pay for every lot or upgrade in cash. You can take a loan from the bank, just make sure you can keep up with the payments each year. Pay on time and your credit score improves, which means cheaper borrowing later. Miss payments and your score drops, which makes future loans more expensive.
